/Title (We remember long-time friend, member, director, and volunteer, Lois Bateman who passed away on December 25th. Lois was an avid birdwatcher, environmentalist and naturalist. She was inquisitive, knowledgeable and would readily engage you on any topic. She will be missed at PSNP.)
