/E (To those of you who would like to contribute time but cannot commit to a specific duty or day, please consider pitching in when the call goes out.   Our goal is to have the chalet open from 9:00 AM- 5:00 PM seven days a week and offer two evenings to enjoy lighted trails.  Next year we hope to offer more night skiing to enjoy the additional 2.5 kms of Lone Pine. For members who may want to become more involved, we offer training on chalet procedures, outfitting for ski and snowshoe rentals, practical guidelines for snowshoe leaders etc.  )
